      "writtenOn": "2020-06-02T21:03:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "PD3 Figure 8.116 shows PE_PRS_SRC_SNK_Evaluate_Swap and PE_PRE_SRC_SNK_Accept_Swap have an explicit contract. It shows at PE_PRS_SRC_SNK_Transition_To_Off the explicit contract is no longer called out and we are transitioning to power off.\n\nI was told the charge manager was only allowed to adjust the Analog Rp when there was only an implicit contract.  Since we shut off power, it made sense to me that this was a better place than waiting for the power to be completely gone before saying the contract was invalid.",
      "parentUuid": "cdec0796_d00a35c9",
