      "writtenOn": "2020-06-02T20:40:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What would you think about having the charge manager cache the Rp value it wants in the TC, and then the TC can set it when we\u0027re advertising initial source current?  The TC has much better knowledge of when it\u0027s appropriate to change Rp in its states",
