      "writtenOn": "2020-06-02T21:03:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see collision management in PRL and setting to CONFIG_USB_PD_PULLUP in TC.  Is Charge Manager the only one that sets this value on connection to a value that is not collision management or CONFIG_USB_PD_PULLUP?  If pd_set_analog_rp_value just cached the value in TC then where would this value gets used to set the initial source current versus the standard CONFIG_USB_PD_PULLUP?",
